		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アデク『……きさま
そんな　くだらぬ　考えで！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
